# Website

> Seb Blanchet

Personal portfolio/blog live at [sebblanchet.com](https://sebblanchet.com).

## Install

Dependencies:

* `uv`

## Developping

### Locally

```bash
uv sync
mkdocs serve
mkdocs build
```

### Docker

```bash
./bin/docker.sh --deploy
```

## Tools

Use cli:

```bash
source .venv/bin/activate
website --help
```

## Deploying

Hosted with Github pages:

```bash
mkdocs gh-deploy
```
